00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:53.820
SOO think of this when every im referring
to Pochita in the past.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:59.259
Pochita I guess ever since chainsaws were
invented or maybe even eternity its not really

00:01:59.259 --> 00:02:03.100
ever told when he came into existence BUT
he was known as the Chainsaw Man in hell.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.950
The source of his fear stemmed from this series
breaking unique ability of his which erases

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:12.230
devils completely from existence and the memory
of everyone and everything by simply munching

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.230
them back.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:17.720
Devils killed in this form cannot continues
their reincarnation cycle which for anyone

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:23.670
who doesn't know when a devil dies on earth
they return to hell and then when they die

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:29.220
in hell they come back to earth n so on until
Pochita is like nah bro time for a meal, that's

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.959
like a suuuper simplified version of it.

00:02:31.959 --> 00:02:35.510
OBVIOUSLY this makes Chainsaw Man a massive
threat to devil-kind and earned him the moniker

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:40.340
of "The Devil that Devils fear the most" or
"The Hero of Hell" depending which side your

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.340
on.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:45.170
This infamy made Pochita the target of a many
devils who tried killing him multiple times,

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.900
but he always found a way to come back and
fight again.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:52.450
His power was a subject of worship for some,
making certain devils follow him like beam,

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:56.200
and the object of fear for others, who ran
away trying to escape him.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.900
This eventually culminated in a battle between
him, the Four Horsemen and the Weapon Devils

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.730
in which he was badly wounded and, according
to Makima, reduced to a "completely changed

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:07.819
near death form", which like I explained just
before is thought to be his dog form.

00:03:07.819 --> 00:03:12.209
At the height of the battle, Pochita vanished,
then was somehow found by Denji on earth.

00:03:12.209 --> 00:03:13.209
How he travelled from hell to earth also isn't
even revealed yet, like we don't exactly know

00:03:13.209 --> 00:03:14.209
how Pochita managed to travel between the
two worlds.

00:03:14.209 --> 00:03:17.120
After what happened at Denji’s fathers Grave,
Pochita who cant communicate and can only

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:21.880
seeming bark like a pup, saw that Denji in
an act of empathy, offered him his blood so

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.560
that he could recover from his wounds BUT
only on the condition that the two would become

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:26.560
future partners.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:30.610
Throughout the few years they spent together
from the time Denji was a child till the current

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:31.610
time period.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:36.200
Pochita would live alongside him in his leaky
shed listening to Denji and all his worries,

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.940
all of his wishes, the food he wanted to eat
and pretty much just everything the two didnt

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:44.290
have in life, while at the same time assisting
him in devil hunting, wood clearing and just

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.450
sharing on whatever rations the broke duo
could afford.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.970
One day after Pochita witnesses Denji cough
up blood both of them are called out on a

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:54.189
mission to take down a Devil by that old Yakuza
dude.

00:03:54.189 --> 00:03:58.400
Yet Denji is sadly duped by this old fart
who ended up forming his own contract with

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.910
the Zombie Devil.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:06.150
After a short and absolutely terrifying struggle
to escape both Denji and Pochita are mortally

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:09.670
wounded by the hundred or so Yakuza-turned-zombies.

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:13.790
After the pair are just left like garbage
in a dumpster, the blood from Denji somehow

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:18.310
thru pure manga luck managed to flow down
and entered Denji's body.

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:21.759
While going over all of the happy moments
that made up their friendship, he remembers

00:04:21.759 --> 00:04:26.590
a specific moment where Denji told him that
if he ever died, to then take over his body

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:29.169
and make his dreams come true for him.

00:04:29.169 --> 00:04:34.009
Coming back to reality Pochita begins morphing
shape and assumes the role of Denji’s heart

00:04:34.009 --> 00:04:38.210
merging with his torso while also repairing
his damaged body in the process.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:42.729
Back in the dream world, In a role reversal
Uno reverse card play, Pochita this time manages

00:04:42.729 --> 00:04:48.150
to save Denji, but unlike how Denji wanted
him to take over his body and mind he didnt,

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:51.900
instead he communicates with him that he’s
always loved listening to Denji talk about

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:52.900
his dreams.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:57.009
Due to of this he explains that he wants to
hear more from him he forms a contract with

00:04:57.009 --> 00:05:03.570
Denji where he will become his heart and in
return Denji will show him all of his dreams.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.229
Throughout the story Pochita's past as the
Chainsaw Man is briefly alluded to only a

00:05:07.229 --> 00:05:08.460
few times before the later arcs.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:14.139
During the extremely long and drawn out battle
with the Eternity Devil where the main part

00:05:14.139 --> 00:05:17.540
