00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:40.860
Im assuming because of this he would in someway
get a huge powerup thru killing him, obviously

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:44.460
he’s not a fan of the chainsaw man and if
he did actually manage to get the kill all

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:48.479
