00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:49.459
This obviously leaves our boy disappointed
as he was extremely hyped to get away from

00:09:49.459 --> 00:09:56.149
Tokyo and spend some time with Makima because
this he later ends up getting extremely depressed

00:09:56.149 --> 00:10:00.450
