is to begin with, and why does everyone wanted

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:13.080
his heart.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:17.300
So if you've seen my entire story video for
part one, you all know what happens to Denji

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.730
and everyone in hell throughout the international
assassination arc.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:24.800
After returning, it extremely effects Powers
mentality to the point where she’s unable

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:29.640
to even do anything by herself over fear of
the darkness devil showing up and killing

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.640
her.

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:34.140
To keep her calm, Denji ends up going to the
toilet with her, constantly reminding her

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:38.510
she's okay and even bathing with her so that
power doesn't freak out while she's alone.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:43.019
This all culminates in an extremely important
moment for the duo where Power offers Denji

00:10:43.019 --> 00:10:47.250
some of her blood as an apology for making
him miss out on his trip with Makima.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.450
Even though they don't realize it at the time
what happens here is so damn important in

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.450
the overall story.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:57.120
While drinking her blood, Denji internally
thinks to Pochita, telling him on how he always

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:00.550
thought naughty things would feel better the
more you know your partner.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:05.050
But even though he knows Power extremely well,
this just doesn't feel hot at all.

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:08.440
He thinks that it probably isn't that you
should learn anything and everything there

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:12.860
is to know, but instead that there are some
things you have to know and some that are

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:13.990
better off unknown.

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:20.120
In that moment he casts off the idea of ever
opening that mysterious door he always see’s

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:21.320
in his dreams.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:27.380
With Aki being the oldest in the group, over
time he began to take this big brother role

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:31.650
and with him being unable to protect his little
family, he became extremely distressed about

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:36.140
the possibility of both of them dying in the
upcoming operation to defeat the Gun Devil.

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:42.820
Aki who’s just trying to keep them safe,
asks Kishibe to quit the operation along with

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:49.590
Denji and Power, surprising Kishibe, who expected
Aki to be the one most eager for the event.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:54.980
However after the group later meets with the
Minecraft hoe herself mummy Makima Aki ends

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:59.990
up getting persuaded to continue in the operation
as either way she was going to force Denji

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:06.200
and Power into going on the mission by simply
changing them from div 4 to division 7.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:12.060
Later, the Future Devil who’s Aki’s new
Devil appears after he was called out to,

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:19.380
(btw just if there is any confusion, if Aki
was to continue using the needle weapon he

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:23.680
