00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:29.269
Plus the Fox devil he used earlier in the
series gapped it and doesn't talk to him anymore

00:12:29.269 --> 00:12:31.910
due to it getting damaged in the Katana Man
battle.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:38.019
Anyways the future Devil who rises up by the
window sends an ominous vision to Aki, stating

00:12:38.019 --> 00:12:43.230
