slaughtered by Denji in a completely and absolutely

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:45.839
unavoidable future.

00:12:45.839 --> 00:12:52.680
After this THE DEVIL THAT DEVILS FEAR MOST
SHALL, foreshadowing Pochita's return in the

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.680
future.

