00:13:26.959 --> 00:13:31.860
Im assuming this didnt instantly kill Aki
or angel and wasn't apart of the vision Aki

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.380
was given.

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:37.290
After Makima does some sorta craziness making
this portal appear above the Gun devil she

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.079
