00:14:05.339 --> 00:14:09.709
Yet as we all know that doesn't exactly work
out and Denji who gave up his emotions to

00:14:09.709 --> 00:14:12.490
Makima was unable to prevent Power's death.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:16.829
To top it off on all of the days she could've
