his cake in her hands.

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:26.220
Left in a crippling depressive state, Denji
asks Makima if it was all dream, unable to

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:29.540
comprehend why she would suddenly do something
like that.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:35.110
Makima then reveals that she wanted to bring
Pochita back since the very beginning, however

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:39.490
she was unable to do so because he had to
stay sealed as Denji's heart due to the promise

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:40.490
between them.

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:44.589
Left with no other choice, she quickly planned
a way to break try and break Denji's will

00:14:44.589 --> 00:14:47.810
and inturn the promise.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:52.709
Makima explains that the promise he made with
Pochita was infact a contract, one that Pochita

00:14:52.709 --> 00:14:57.540
would remain as Denji's heart as long as Denji
fulfilled his dreams of living a normal life.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:02.490
Thus, Makima went around planning a normal
life for Denji, making him live with Aki and

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:06.180
Power in the hopes that they would become
like a family to and make that happiness his

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:07.180
new normal.

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:12.000
Then once that was set in place she would
destroy the whole thing, any form of happiness

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:16.820
or sadness from this point on would be solely
crafted by her in a tactic to manipulate him

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:21.530
ever further as she believes its time that
he atone for Pochita’s previous sins.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:25.880
Finally, in a moment that im not even sure
if its true or not to this day, she reveals

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:29.810
that Denji infact killed his own father and
manipulates him into believing that he was

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:33.980
a horrible person because of his patricide
and therefore did not deserve to live his

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.480
dream of having a normal life...

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:40.569
Hearing this over and over again, it flashes
into Denji's dream world where he’s still

00:15:40.569 --> 00:15:46.730
a child and ends up agreeing with her as he
now has just been gaslighted into believing

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.480
it was true.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:54.300
Then with that finally complete Makima successfully
breaks Denji's contract with Pochita, leaving

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.940
the boy on the couch in a completely unresponsive
state.

00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:03.480
The day after, Makima walks alongside a catatonic
Denji in a hallway filled with all of Tokyo's

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.279
Special Division 4 Devils and Fiends.

00:16:06.279 --> 00:16:10.959
Makima then reveals that every single one
of them were followers of the original Chainsaw

00:16:10.959 --> 00:16:14.990
Devil in hell, and that they were all waiting
for his "resurrection".

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:19.360
Being caught off guard an unexpected explosion
goes off blowing up the side of the building

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:24.180
and showing the the absolute g himself big
teacher Kishibe has brought in an entire division

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.540
to kill Makima.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:29.360
In combination with this first move a few
of his other top agents then begin summoning

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:33.490
