Makima and send her back to hell.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:39.380
However, Makima suddenly enlists the help
of Chainsaw Man, forcing Pochita to take over

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.220
Denji's catatonic body.

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:48.540
This is obviously now due to the fact that
the promise or contract was just broken, marking

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:53.610
