00:16:54.610 --> 00:17:00.839
Pochita quickly disposes of the Hell Devil,
turning him into a couple bits of hell devil

00:17:00.839 --> 00:17:01.839
shichimi.

00:17:01.839 --> 00:17:07.870
Honestly such a clean panel, always loved
this one, where you finally see the Full Chainsaw

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:10.000
Man form for the first time..

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:14.540
Anyways a remaining agent uses himself to
revive the hell devil back, telling him to

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.300
