00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:51.960
Pochita is able to erase a devil's existence
and the concept they represent by eating them,

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:59.210
even now Makima remembers the battles themselves
but the names have started to fade.

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:03.250
Its shown that a confused Kishibe doesn't
even know what the Nazi’s regime was or

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:07.950
that chainsaw man has already erased things
from the world like aids, world war 2, nukes,

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:11.539
the light of a specific start that breaks
a childs mind, the four other conclusions

00:18:11.539 --> 00:18:16.309
other than death at the end of life and much
much more have already been erased from existence

00:18:16.309 --> 00:18:17.630
