00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:21.730
Mummy Makima explains that her goal is that
she’s planning to fight him in order to

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:26.400
defeat and control his power with the aim
of erasing concepts that she deems unnecessary

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:30.740
