00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:35.580
Kishibe then asks her if she's not afraid
of losing, which she responds by saying that

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:39.720
she wouldn't mind being devoured by Pochita
as she is a big fan of the chainsaw man.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:40.840
Which holy moly I freaking love this line,
